  "summary": "A multimodal setup combining RNA (pca_n2000) and image (resnet50) modalities with concat fusion was tested on singleprofile data. Validation accuracy of 0.5266 and F1 of 0.5104 suggest a baseline performance for this configuration. The effectiveness of multimodal integration compared to single-modality approaches remains uncertain without direct comparative benchmarks."
